  "city-upgrade-list": "\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"mind-division-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"5000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>思维分割</h2><p>可升3级，每级使集中比例+0.5个百分点，并自然联动杀气。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"mind-division-preview\">当前：0/3级</span><small id=\"mind-division-cost\">消耗 5e15 战力</small><button id=\"buy-mind-division\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"hyper-regeneration-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"100000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>超速再生</h2><p>将再生倍率由×5提升至×15，并增加20级健身上限。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"hyper-regeneration-preview\">解锁后：再生 ×15；健身上限 +20</span><small>消耗 1e17 战力</small><button id=\"buy-hyper-regeneration\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"mental-domain-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"300000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>精神领域</h2><p>使鬼脑独立战力来源×5。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"mental-domain-preview\">解锁后：鬼脑来源倍率 ×5</span><small>消耗 3e17 战力</small><button id=\"buy-mental-domain\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"earth-split-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"800000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>裂地</h2><p>根据当前打岩等级提高崩山指数，并使打岩等级上限 +20。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"earth-split-preview\">解锁后：崩山指数随当前打岩等级提高；打岩上限 +20</span><small>消耗 8e17 战力</small><button id=\"buy-earth-split\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"godspeed-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"1200000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>神速</h2><p>根据当前战力提高音速移动指数，使音速移动倍率由 ×3.8 提升为 ×(3.8^x)。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"godspeed-preview\">解锁后：音速移动指数 1.015；音速移动倍率 ×3.88</span><small>消耗 1.2e18 战力</small><button id=\"buy-godspeed\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"superpower-evolution-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"2000000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>异能进化</h2><p>将异能的战力区域指数由 1.05 提高至 1.06。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"superpower-evolution-preview\">解锁后：异能指数 1.06</span><small>消耗 2e18 战力</small><button id=\"buy-superpower-evolution\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"subtle-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"4000000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>入微</h2><p>使集中来源在来源软上限前提高至^1.05。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"subtle-preview\">解锁后：集中来源 ^1.05</span><small>消耗 4e18 战力</small><button id=\"buy-subtle\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                  <article class=\"item-row\" id=\"sky-split-upgrade\" data-sort-cost=\"8000000000000000000\">\n                    <div class=\"item-content\"><h2>裂天</h2><p>根据当前战力持续提高鬼脑来源倍率。</p></div>\n                    <div class=\"purchase-control\"><span id=\"sky-split-preview\">解锁后：鬼脑来源倍率 ×1</span><small>消耗 8e18 战力</small><button id=\"buy-sky-split\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">升级</button></div>\n                  </article>\n                ",
